     9	// A saved name can later identify a different host, executable or state tree.
    10	// Snapshot the complete profile in rows so old views cannot acknowledge the
    11	// replacement's results. Runtime generations also isolate removed/readded
    12	// profiles; durable records are scoped to this local viewer and exact route.
